<header class="sticky top-0 z-30 border-b border-[#e8ebe3] bg-white/95 backdrop-blur">
  <div class="mx-auto flex h-16 max-w-6xl items-center justify-between px-5 sm:px-8">
    <%= link_to root_path, class: "text-xl font-bold tracking-tight text-[#285b46]" do %>Stock<span class="text-[#88a86e]">Dish</span><% end %>
    <div class="flex items-center gap-3 sm:gap-5">
      <%= link_to "ログイン", login_path, class: "text-sm font-semibold text-[#526258] transition hover:text-[#285b46]" %>
      <%= link_to "無料で始める", new_user_path, class: "rounded-xl bg-[#285b46] px-4 py-2.5 text-sm font-bold text-white transition hover:bg-[#1f4938] sm:px-5" %>
    </div>
  </div>
</header>

<main class="overflow-hidden">
  <section class="bg-[#f6f7f2] px-5 py-12 sm:px-8 sm:py-20">
    <div class="mx-auto grid max-w-6xl items-center gap-10 lg:grid-cols-[1.05fr_0.95fr] lg:gap-16">
      <div>
        <div class="mb-6 inline-flex items-center gap-2 rounded-full border border-[#dce7d1] bg-white px-4 py-2 text-xs font-bold text-[#527b61]">
          <span class="h-2 w-2 rounded-full bg-[#88a86e]"></span>食材ロスを減らすスマートレシピ
        </div>
        <h1 class="max-w-xl text-4xl font-bold leading-tight tracking-tight text-[#285b46] sm:text-5xl">冷蔵庫の中身が、<span class="text-[#88a86e]">今夜の献立</span>になる</h1>
        <p class="mt-5 max-w-xl text-base leading-7 text-[#718078]">手持ちの食材・調味料を登録するだけ。今あるものから、今日作れるレシピを見つけましょう。</p>
        <div class="mt-8 flex flex-wrap gap-3">
          <%= link_to "無料で登録する →", new_user_path, class: "rounded-xl bg-[#285b46] px-6 py-3.5 text-sm font-bold text-white shadow-sm transition hover:bg-[#1f4938]" %>
          <%= link_to "使い方を見る", "#how-it-works", class: "rounded-xl border border-[#ccd8ca] bg-white px-6 py-3.5 text-sm font-bold text-[#285b46] transition hover:bg-[#f4f7ef]" %>
        </div>
      </div>
      <div class="relative mx-auto w-full max-w-lg">
        <div class="absolute -inset-4 rounded-[2rem] bg-[#dfedb9]/65 sm:-inset-6"></div>
        <div class="relative rounded-[1.5rem] bg-[#285b46] p-5 text-white shadow-xl sm:p-7">
          <div class="flex items-center justify-between">
            <div><p class="text-[10px] font-bold tracking-[0.2em] text-[#d9e9bf]">YOUR KITCHEN</p><p class="mt-1 text-lg font-bold">今日のストック</p></div>
            <span class="flex h-11 w-11 items-center justify-center rounded-full bg-white/15 text-2xl" aria-hidden="true">🥗</span>
          </div>
          <div class="mt-5 rounded-2xl bg-white p-4 text-[#34463b]">
            <p class="text-xs font-semibold text-[#8a968d]">冷蔵庫にある食材</p>
            <div class="mt-3 flex flex-wrap gap-2">
              <span class="rounded-full bg-[#dfedb9] px-3 py-1.5 text-sm font-bold text-[#285b46]">卵</span>
              <span class="rounded-full bg-[#dfedb9] px-3 py-1.5 text-sm font-bold text-[#285b46]">玉ねぎ</span>
              <span class="rounded-full bg-[#f2f5eb] px-3 py-1.5 text-sm font-bold text-[#526258]">にんじん</span>
              <span class="rounded-full bg-[#fbf0e2] px-3 py-1.5 text-sm font-bold text-[#a96828]">鮭 · 期限間近</span>
            </div>
          </div>
          <div class="mt-3 flex items-center gap-3 rounded-2xl bg-[#dfedb9] p-4 text-[#285b46]">
            <span class="text-2xl" aria-hidden="true">✧</span><div><p class="text-[10px] font-bold tracking-wider">TODAY'S IDEA</p><p class="mt-0.5 text-sm font-bold">鮭と野菜のかんたん蒸し</p></div><span class="ml-auto">→</span>
          </div>
        </div>
      </div>
    </div>
  </section>

  <section id="how-it-works" class="mx-auto max-w-6xl px-5 py-16 sm:px-8 sm:py-20">
    <p class="text-center text-xs font-bold tracking-[0.2em] text-[#718078]">HOW IT WORKS</p>
    <h2 class="mt-2 text-center text-2xl font-bold text-[#285b46] sm:text-3xl">使い方はかんたん3ステップ</h2>
    <div class="mt-10 grid gap-4 md:grid-cols-3">
      <% [["01", "食材・調味料を登録", "冷蔵庫にあるものを登録して、ストックを見える化。"], ["02", "レシピを提案", "手持ちの食材から、今作れるメニューを探せます。"], ["03", "作って、記録", "気に入ったレシピを保存して、次の献立選びに。"]].each do |number, title, description| %>
        <article class="rounded-2xl border border-[#e7e9e1] bg-white p-6 shadow-[0_2px_12px_rgba(40,91,70,0.03)]">
          <p class="text-2xl font-bold text-[#a9c285]"><%= number %></p><h3 class="mt-3 font-bold text-[#34463b]"><%= title %></h3><p class="mt-2 text-sm leading-6 text-[#718078]"><%= description %></p>
        </article>
      <% end %>
    </div>
  </section>

  <section class="border-y border-[#e8ebe3] bg-white px-5 py-16 sm:px-8 sm:py-20">
    <div class="mx-auto max-w-6xl">
      <p class="text-center text-xs font-bold tracking-[0.2em] text-[#718078]">FEATURES</p><h2 class="mt-2 text-center text-2xl font-bold text-[#285b46] sm:text-3xl">StockDishでできること</h2>
      <div class="mt-10 grid gap-8 md:grid-cols-3">
        <% [["🧊", "食材の在庫管理", "家にあるものをいつでも確認。買い物前のチェックにも便利です。"], ["⌛", "期限のお知らせ", "期限の近い食材がわかるから、使い切りをサポートします。"], ["🍳", "レシピ提案", "「何を作ろう」で迷ったとき、手持ちの食材から考えられます。"]].each do |icon, title, description| %>
          <article><span class="text-3xl" aria-hidden="true"><%= icon %></span><h3 class="mt-3 font-bold text-[#34463b]"><%= title %></h3><p class="mt-2 text-sm leading-6 text-[#718078]"><%= description %></p></article>
        <% end %>
      </div>
    </div>
  </section>

  <section class="mx-5 my-14 rounded-3xl bg-[#dfedb9] px-6 py-12 text-center sm:mx-8 sm:my-20 sm:px-12">
    <h2 class="text-2xl font-bold text-[#285b46] sm:text-3xl">もう「何作ろう」で悩まない</h2>
    <p class="mt-3 text-sm leading-6 text-[#526258]">毎日の献立をもっと気軽に。<br>無料登録で、今日から始めましょう。</p>
    <%= link_to "無料で登録する", new_user_path, class: "mt-6 inline-flex rounded-xl bg-[#285b46] px-7 py-3.5 text-sm font-bold text-white transition hover:bg-[#1f4938]" %>
  </section>
</main>

<footer class="border-t border-[#e8ebe3] py-7 text-center text-xs text-[#8a968d]">© 2026 StockDish · 冷蔵庫から始まる、毎日の料理</footer>
